  "bodyHash": "7966d16c3a9fd95e",
  "content": "\n\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/0BsNlDT.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/C2JV3xu.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 36px;\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Available%20for%20Minecraft-1.19%20%7C%201.18-ecebe6?labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge\" width=\"295\" height=\"28\" />&emsp;<img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Install%20on-Client%20%26%20Server-ecebe6?labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge\" width=\"240\" height=\"28\" /></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 36px;\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/magnum-torch-forge/files/all?filter-status=1&amp;filter-game-version=2020709689%3A7498\"><img src=\"https://bit.ly/3yrSsw7\" width=\"320\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/puzzles-lib\"><img src=\"https://bit.ly/3jr9xQw\" width=\"215\" height=\"28\" /></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 36px;\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/magnum-torch-forge/files/all?filter-status=1&amp;filter-game-version=2020709689%3A7499\"><img src=\"https://bit.ly/3nRXr4m\" width=\"325\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fabric-api\"><img src=\"https://bit.ly/30lZmFY\" width=\"208\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/puzzles-lib\"><img src=\"https://bit.ly/3jr9xQw\" width=\"215\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/forge-config-api-port-fabric\"><img src=\"https://bit.ly/3clkhvn\" width=\"299\" height=\"28\" /></a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/C2JV3xu.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><strong>📖 简介：</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>Magnum Torch</strong> 添加了三种威力强大的火把，可以在极大范围内阻止生物生成。仅阻止自然生成，例如刷怪笼和袭击事件仍会正常运作。</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/C2JV3xu.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><strong>📚 内容：</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">你制作的巨型火把类型决定了将阻止哪类生物生成。仅阻止新生成的生物，在放置巨型火把时，世界中已存在的生物不会立即消失！</span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>钻石：</strong>所有敌对生物，如僵尸、骷髅、苦力怕、蜘蛛、幻翼等。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>绿宝石：</strong>被动生物，如流浪商人和商人驼（动物在技术上受影响，但实际上不受影响，因为它们仅在世界生成或繁殖时出现，这两种情况均不受巨型火把影响）</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>紫水晶：</strong>洞穴和水生生物，如蝙蝠、所有鱿鱼、美西螈和所有鱼类</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">更好的是：每种巨型火把都完全支持自定义，包括有效范围、阻止生成的形状（长方体、圆柱体、椭球体）、针对单个生物的白名单/黑名单、以及被阻止的生物类型（敌对/水生/洞穴/被动）。因此，你可以完全改变不同种类火把的功能，例如让一种只阻止幻翼生成，另一种专门处理流浪商人，而第三种禁用所有鱼类。完全由你决定！</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/C2JV3xu.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><strong>📷 媒体：</strong></span></p>\n<table style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/440/542/2022-03-12_15.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"231\" /></td>\n<td>&emsp;&emsp;</td>\n<td><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/440/543/2022-03-13_11.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"231\" /></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>三种巨型火把，分别阻止不同类型的生物生成</strong></td>\n<td>&emsp;&emsp;</td>\n<td><strong>村庄中的绿宝石巨型火把</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/440/544/2022-03-13_11.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"231\" /></td>\n<td>&emsp;&emsp;</td>\n<td><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/440/545/2022-03-13_10.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"231\" /></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>物品提示框显示你需要知道的所有重要参数</strong></td>\n<td>&emsp;&emsp;</td>\n<td><strong>合成钻石巨型火把</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/440/546/2022-03-13_10.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"231\" /></td>\n<td>&emsp;&emsp;</td>\n<td><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/440/547/2022-03-13_10.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"231\" /></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>合成绿宝石巨型火把</strong></td>\n<td>&emsp;&emsp;</td>\n<td><strong>合成紫水晶巨型火把</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/C2JV3xu.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><strong>💡 常见问题：</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>Q: 如何在 Forge 上配置此模组？<br /><strong>A:</strong> 安装我的 <span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/config-menus-forge\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>Config Menus for Forge</strong></span></a> 模组，即可直接在游戏内配置！</span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>Q: 如何在 Fabric 上配置此模组？<br /><strong>A:</strong> 目前尚未实现在游戏内直接编辑配置文件。相反，当你在世界中时，运行 <code>/config showfile &lt;modid&gt;</code> 命令并选择 <code>CLIENT</code> 或 <code>SERVER</code>（取决于模组），然后点击聊天栏中出现的文件名（以 .toml 结尾），即可在外部编辑器中手动编辑配置文件。保存文件后，配置文件将在几秒后自动在游戏内重载，无需重启游戏。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>Q: 如何下载 1.19 之前版本的 Fabric 模组？<br /><strong>A:</strong> 旧版下载地址请访问 <span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/magnum-torch-fabric\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>旧项目页面</strong></span></a>.</span></span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/C2JV3xu.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><strong>🏆 鸣谢：</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">开发 Magnum Torch 得到了以下启发与帮助：</span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/rwtema\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>RWTema</strong></span></a> 启发本模组，灵感来源于其旧版模组 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/extra-utilities\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Extra Utilities</span></a> 中的巨型火把方块</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/nyffuuuh23\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>Nyffuuuh23</strong></span></a> 提供了精美的纹理素材</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/C2JV3xu.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 36px;\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/lunapixelstudios/projects\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=CurseForge&amp;message=LunaPixelStudios&amp;color=ecebe6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=curseforge&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"282\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://twitter.com/LunaPixelStudio\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/twitter/follow/LunaPixelStudio?label=Twitter&amp;color=ecebe6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=twitter&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"149\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://discord.gg/8ZmhaPPbjE\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/790272037578473512?label=Discord&amp;color=ecebe6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=discord&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"220\" height=\"28\" /></a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/1MOyd2u.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"300\" /></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 36px;\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/fuzs_/projects\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Fuzs_&amp;color=ecebe6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=curseforge&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"97\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://github.com/Fuzss\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Fuzss&amp;color=ecebe6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=github&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"97\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC2l26SuCmCNSCPefpfbCX7Q\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Fuzs&amp;color=ecebe6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=youtube&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"89\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://twitter.com/Fusseel\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=@Fusseel&amp;color=ecebe6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=twitter&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"124\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://www.reddit.com/user/Fusseel\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=u/Fusseel&amp;color=ecebe6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=reddit&amp;logoColor=white\" alt=\"Reddit\" width=\"130\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Fuzs%200212&amp;color=ecebe6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=discord&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"127\" height=\"28\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/C2JV3xu.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<table style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/config-menus-forge\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/kiHP8s9.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\" /></a></td>\n<td>&emsp;&emsp;</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/universal-bone-meal-forge\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/q3CooZb.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\" /></a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/bag-of-holding-forge\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/8gTQlTt.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\" /></a></td>\n<td>&emsp;&emsp;</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/block-runner-forge\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/5rv6nTt.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\" /></a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/easy-shulker-boxes-forge\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/vz0tBff.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\" /></a></td>\n<td>&emsp;&emsp;</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/universal-enchants-forge\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/MynoO6R.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\" /></a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/sneaky-curses-forge\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/LgxIMFS.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\" /></a></td>\n<td>&emsp;&emsp;</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/trading-post\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/UzgNFIB.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\" /></a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/better-animations-collection\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/OVV5lXk.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\" /></a></td>\n<td>&emsp;&emsp;</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/stylish-effects\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/fmWwWkZ.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\" /></a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/C2JV3xu.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>",
